.MARINE...
(Today through Friday)
Issued at 850 AM PDT Sun Aug 16 2026

A gentle to moderate northwesterly breeze persists into Monday
with localized fresh gusts possible across the interior waters.
Winds increase to fresh to strong late Monday and remain elevated
through the end of the forecast period. Seas of around 4 to 5
feet will build to 7 to 8 feet by mid week. A long period
southerly swell around 15 to 17 seconds will continue to diminish
through the early work week.

